# BOOLEAN: Boolean is a tool session as UE UCSGMeshesTool - the result of a 100 cm Box and a radius-50 Sphere previews on the Box (the Sphere hidden), a change of operation recomputes it, Cancel leaves both inputs, Accept writes it as one undo step
# The Box is red (CB_Red), the Sphere green (CB_Green): the preview and the result carry both inputs' materials (UE
# UCSGMeshesTool's combined material set, B's material IDs shifted past A's slots).
# The Sphere sits over the Box's +X top edge (Translation 40,60,40): Difference leaves a spherical bite, Union a bulge.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 230,260,300
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.5,-0.45,-0.74
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Width 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Depth 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Height 100
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано set selected StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/CB_Red.demat
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.Radius 50
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 40,60,40
Дано set selected StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/CB_Green.demat
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 150,190,180
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Boolean operation: Difference A - B"
Дано run Modeling "Boolean write to: Input"
Дано run Modeling "Boolean inputs: Delete Inputs"
Тогда-вид 0_inputs the red Box with the green Sphere sunk into its near top corner
Когда run Modeling "Boolean tool: Boolean"
Тогда 1_preview_diff the red Box shows a smooth spherical bite (its inner wall green, from the Sphere) where the Sphere was; the Sphere itself is hidden; the tool bar at the viewport bottom reads Boolean with Accept and Cancel; Outliner still lists both Box and Sphere
Когда run Modeling "Boolean operation: Union"
Тогда 2_preview_union the Box and the Sphere fused into one surface (the sphere's dome bulging out of the Box) - the Box part red, the dome green; the tool bar still reads Boolean
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда 3_cancel the whole Box and the Sphere in its corner, as before the tool; no tool bar; Outliner lists Box and Sphere only
Когда run Entity Box
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда run Modeling "Boolean operation: Difference A - B"
Когда run Modeling "Boolean tool: Boolean"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда 4_accept the red Box with a spherical bite whose inner wall stays green (Details: Material Slots CB_Red, CB_Green), the Sphere gone from viewport and Outliner (one mesh entity, Box); no tool bar
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда 5_undo the Box is whole again and the Sphere is back in its corner; Outliner lists both
